# Environment variables for onchain-finance.
#
# The project is currently docs-only (see README.md) — no application exists yet,
# so no environment variables are required to run anything. This file exists as a
# placeholder so future secrets/config have a documented home from the start.
#
# When real config is introduced, add each variable here with a placeholder value
# and a comment explaining its purpose. Never commit a real .env file (see .gitignore).
